# slider-parked-right (h8-points-slider): p=8 parks right only past the
# visible range, so the query also centres at -2 (maxX 7.9 < 8; bare p=8 at
# this frame sits at 309.14px unparked, measured). Hovered: the thumb parks
# at width-INSET with the parked mark, data-parked="right", the tip with the
# right triangle clamped flush to the track's right edge.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query p=8&center=-2,0
wait 500
move 200 748
wait 200
shot slider-parked-right
